The usage management interface references the behavior and information
organization of frontend/src/views/usage/ and frontend/src/api/modules/usage.ts
in the source project, including overview/insight cards, usage record queries,
request details, and diagnostic exports. The local implementation adapts this
work to React, CPA management API contracts, CPA localization, and CPA token
accounting. Upstream fields that CPA does not collect are not synthesized.

The adaptation scope and per-feature validation status are maintained in the
paired backend repository nanashiwang/CLIProxyAPI:
  docs/CODEX_PROXY_USAGE_SYNC_CN.md
  .github/upstream/codex-proxy-usage.json

